1
00:00:45,039 --> 00:00:46,399
Mom...

2
00:00:52,439 --> 00:00:53,600
Mom...

3
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:57,880
Mom, wake up.

4
00:00:57,880 --> 00:00:59,640
Mom!

5
00:01:22,319 --> 00:01:23,200
Yes, exactly.

6
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:25,920
The person I recommended is Shen Yu.

7
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:28,480
I planned to introduce you two directly,

8
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:30,840
but he insisted on going to see you himself.

9
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,400
Is he a student of yours, too?

10
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:34,719
He's the son of an old friend of mine,

11
00:01:35,079 --> 00:01:36,640
just back from studying abroad.

12
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:38,159
He majored in finance and law,

13
00:01:38,159 --> 00:01:39,560
with a minor in psychology.

14
00:01:39,719 --> 00:01:40,719
What do you think?

15
00:01:40,959 --> 00:01:42,400
Being your assistant for two months,

16
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:44,239
he's more than qualified, isn't he?

17
00:01:45,319 --> 00:01:46,760
Having someone like him as my assistant

18
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:48,000
feels like a bit of overkill.

19
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:50,840
Shen Yu's brother...

20
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:52,959
is Shen Xian.

21
00:01:56,799 --> 00:01:58,000
Is he here to investigate

22
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,200
that serial murder case from back then?

23
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,159
That's your own guess.

24
00:02:01,159 --> 00:02:02,680
I never said that.

25
00:02:03,319 --> 00:02:04,319
Fine.

26
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:09,960
Back then, the first victim

27
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:12,520
was Shen Yu's brother, Shen Xian.

28
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:14,039
The second victim

29
00:02:14,639 --> 00:02:16,159
was in charge of Shen Xian's case—

30
00:02:16,159 --> 00:02:17,319
the prosecutor,

31
00:02:17,639 --> 00:02:19,479
my mother.

32
00:03:11,439 --> 00:03:12,520
Hello?

33
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:13,360
Gu Yan.

34
00:03:13,879 --> 00:03:14,879
We interrogated Zhang Dafeng

35
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,439
about the coins,

36
00:03:16,439 --> 00:03:17,960
but couldn't get him to talk.

37
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:20,800
We now suspect he has a mental disorder.

38
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:21,919
Right now, it looks like

39
00:03:21,919 --> 00:03:22,879
multiple personalities.

40
00:03:22,879 --> 00:03:24,080
That's right.

41
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:27,680
Based on his childhood and teenage years,

42
00:03:27,879 --> 00:03:30,199
it's very likely he has this condition.

43
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:33,800
Zhang Dafeng was sent to a psych ward

44
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,039
for a forensic evaluation.

45
00:03:35,479 --> 00:03:37,360
Since it involves a major criminal case,

46
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:39,280
it'll take at least a month or so

47
00:03:39,599 --> 00:03:40,680
for long-term observation.

48
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:42,120
All right, I got it.

49
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:04,599
If Zhang Dafeng went to a psych ward,

50
00:04:04,599 --> 00:04:06,120
to find any leads,

51
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,840
we'll have to make a trip there.

52
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:08,680
Let's go.

53
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:10,360
Off to the psychiatric hospital.

54
00:04:54,439 --> 00:04:55,360
Hey, Gu Yan.

55
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,720
Something terrible happened.

56
00:04:57,199 --> 00:04:58,519
A pregnant woman died in Hong'an Community.

57
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:00,560
Today is

58
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:02,279
October 14, 2012.

59
00:05:02,639 --> 00:05:03,240
Sunny.

60
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:05,680
A tragic case occurred in Hong'an Community.

61
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:07,839
Wu Qimeng, a 28-year-old pregnant woman,

62
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:10,439
is suspected of being murdered at home.

63
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:13,199
The media exposed the case to the public,

64
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:15,079
putting intense pressure on the police.

65
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,680
If it's a homicide,

66
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:18,839
it might also alert the killer.

67
00:05:18,839 --> 00:05:20,160
The caller was the victim's nanny.

68
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:21,399
Before we even reached the community,

69
00:05:21,399 --> 00:05:22,959
she had already spread word of the murder

70
00:05:22,959 --> 00:05:24,160
across the entire neighborhood.

71
00:05:24,319 --> 00:05:25,120
Otherwise,

72
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,959
a crowd wouldn't have gathered to watch.

73
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,680
What about her husband?

74
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:30,000
Was she home alone?

75
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,639
He went on a business trip yesterday,

76
00:05:31,639 --> 00:05:32,639
so he wasn't at home.

77
00:05:32,959 --> 00:05:34,040
He's rushing back right now.

78
00:05:36,759 --> 00:05:38,600
We have too few leads right now.

79
00:05:39,079 --> 00:05:40,040
As for suspects,

80
00:05:40,759 --> 00:05:41,920
there are countless possibilities.

81
00:05:43,199 --> 00:05:44,240
A pregnant woman brutally killed—

82
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:45,319
the public outcry is enormous.

83
00:05:45,759 --> 00:05:47,040
We must solve this as soon as possible.

84
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:48,879
Here are the crime scene files.

85
00:05:49,199 --> 00:05:50,160
Take a look first.

86
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:51,920
I'll return Chief Zhou's call.

87
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:02,199
Wu Qimeng was

88
00:06:02,199 --> 00:06:03,759
strangled to death.

89
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:05,800
Based on the ambient temperature

90
00:06:06,079 --> 00:06:07,879
and the body's condition, the ME deduced

91
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,800
that the time of death was likely

92
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:10,839
on October 14,

93
00:06:10,839 --> 00:06:12,480
between 8:00 p.m. and midnight.

94
00:06:12,759 --> 00:06:14,879
She was sexually assaulted before death,

95
00:06:15,319 --> 00:06:17,040
but no semen was found in her body.

96
00:06:17,959 --> 00:06:20,199
Nor was there any skin tissue under her nails.

97
00:06:21,199 --> 00:06:23,959
Strangled, yet her fingernails were spotless,

98
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,439
showing the body was cleaned on purpose.

99
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:31,480
The victim's husband,

100
00:06:31,839 --> 00:06:32,519
Li Changyu,

101
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:33,560
a corporate executive,

102
00:06:34,079 --> 00:06:34,839
on the day of the crime,

103
00:06:34,839 --> 00:06:36,480
went to the airport at 5:00 p.m.

104
00:06:36,519 --> 00:06:38,319
The nanny got off work at the same time.

105
00:06:38,639 --> 00:06:40,240
So the initial assessment is

106
00:06:40,439 --> 00:06:41,759
that someone, that night,

107
00:06:41,759 --> 00:06:43,120
between 8:00 p.m. and midnight,

108
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:44,240
slipped into the house

109
00:06:44,519 --> 00:06:45,199
and

110
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,439
assaulted the pregnant woman.

111
00:06:48,839 --> 00:06:50,160
A murder took place,

112
00:06:50,199 --> 00:06:52,839
yet there were no signs of a struggle,

113
00:06:52,839 --> 00:06:54,279
nor was the door lock damaged.

114
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,839
It's very likely this person

115
00:06:55,839 --> 00:06:56,959
was someone Wu Qimeng knew.

116
00:07:06,759 --> 00:07:07,920
It rained last night.

117
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,399
The suspect's shoes were wet,

118
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:10,839
leaving marks on the floor.

119
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:12,519
Can the footprints determine

120
00:07:12,519 --> 00:07:14,000
a person's height and weight?

121
00:07:14,199 --> 00:07:14,759
No.

122
00:07:14,759 --> 00:07:16,120
This is smooth wooden flooring.

123
00:07:16,639 --> 00:07:17,959
Unlike on muddy ground,

124
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:20,000
we can't use its depth and other data

125
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,759
to gauge the suspect's height and weight.

126
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,839
But look at these footprints.

127
00:07:24,279 --> 00:07:25,360
The stride is long,

128
00:07:25,639 --> 00:07:27,839
the distance between steps is very even,

129
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,199
and he walked in a straight line.

130
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:31,000
All signs indicate

131
00:07:31,199 --> 00:07:31,800
that the suspect

132
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,519
is between 25 and 35 years old,

133
00:07:33,519 --> 00:07:34,399
a young male.

134
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:38,399
Last night's rain started after 8:00 p.m.

135
00:07:39,399 --> 00:07:41,480
We can check the main gate's surveillance

136
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:42,480
to screen anyone during this period

137
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:44,439
up until Wu Qimeng's death,

138
00:07:44,439 --> 00:07:45,680
looking for all 25- to 35-year-old

139
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:46,639
young males.

140
00:07:46,759 --> 00:07:48,680
That'll narrow down the suspect pool.

141
00:07:49,839 --> 00:07:50,560
Understood, Chief Zhou.

142
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:51,279
Don't worry.

143
00:07:53,839 --> 00:07:55,279
Regarding her husband, Li Changyu,

144
00:07:55,279 --> 00:07:56,199
we checked his whereabouts.

145
00:07:56,319 --> 00:07:58,160
Based on the gate's security footage,

146
00:07:58,560 --> 00:08:00,360
Li Changyu and the nanny left at 5:00 p.m.

147
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:01,800
Neither of them returned home.

148
00:08:02,399 --> 00:08:04,360
Based on the estimated time of the crime,

149
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:05,759
both Li Changyu and the nanny

150
00:08:05,759 --> 00:08:06,759
have alibis.

151
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:10,120
Besides the two of them,

152
00:08:10,279 --> 00:08:11,279
did Wu Qimeng see anyone else?

153
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,079
Yes.

154
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:14,199
Wu Qimeng's best friend, Wang Lili,

155
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:16,040
arrived at her place at 8:00 p.m.

156
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,480
and left at 8:30.

157
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:18,639
According to her,

158
00:08:18,839 --> 00:08:20,199
when she left,

159
00:08:20,199 --> 00:08:21,519
Wu Qimeng was perfectly fine.

160
00:08:21,879 --> 00:08:22,759
The community surveillance footage

161
00:08:22,759 --> 00:08:23,439
has also been verified.

162
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:24,879
All three statements

163
00:08:24,879 --> 00:08:25,839
align with the timeline.

164
00:08:26,279 --> 00:08:27,240
However,

165
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:28,560
because the community cameras

166
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,560
have been undergoing maintenance,

167
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:30,360
currently,

168
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:31,399
we only have footage

169
00:08:31,399 --> 00:08:32,200
from the community's main gate

170
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:33,039
to refer to.

171
00:08:33,919 --> 00:08:34,759
What a coincidence.

172
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:37,840
The medical examiner said

173
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:39,600
the time of death was

174
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:40,879
between 8:00 p.m. and midnight.

175
00:08:42,039 --> 00:08:43,200
Did the main gate's cameras

176
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:44,919
capture anyone suspicious at the gate?

177
00:08:44,919 --> 00:08:45,919
We're checking that now.

178
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,240
However, at that hour,

179
00:08:47,559 --> 00:08:49,320
few strangers entered or left.

180
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:51,600
Most were regular residents.

181
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:52,720
No strangers?

182
00:08:54,559 --> 00:08:55,720
Someone in the community?

183
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,159
What about a secret lover?

184
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,639
I considered that too.

185
00:08:59,120 --> 00:08:59,799
However, the nanny

186
00:08:59,799 --> 00:09:01,240
and the victim's best friend, Wang Lili,

187
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:03,360
both said the couple got along very well.

188
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,840
Wu Qimeng was also highly regarded here.

189
00:09:06,159 --> 00:09:07,960
She often baked pastries

190
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:08,960
and handed them out to neighbors.

191
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:09,840
Furthermore,

192
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:11,200
no one ever mentioned

193
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,720
her having contact with other men.

194
00:09:13,559 --> 00:09:14,480
Suspect Profile:

195
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:15,200
Male.

196
00:09:15,519 --> 00:09:16,960
Between 25 and 35 years old.

197
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,200
Likely works in a profession

198
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:20,200
that allows easy contact with people.

199
00:09:20,399 --> 00:09:21,799
Judging by how casually he entered

200
00:09:21,799 --> 00:09:23,320
a client's home,

201
00:09:23,759 --> 00:09:25,840
he likely has a prior criminal record.

202
00:09:28,799 --> 00:09:29,360
Hello.

203
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,360
Who ordered takeout?

204
00:09:32,919 --> 00:09:33,559
That's me.

205
00:09:34,679 --> 00:09:35,879
It's lunch time anyway,

206
00:09:35,879 --> 00:09:37,159
so I ordered food for everyone in advance.

207
00:09:39,799 --> 00:09:40,639
Thanks!

208
00:09:56,879 --> 00:09:58,399
Those who can freely open someone's door,

209
00:09:58,840 --> 00:09:59,919
other than acquaintances,

210
00:10:00,039 --> 00:10:01,759
also include delivery men and couriers.
